# Civil War Strategy: the Files menu and Resume Saved Game (cws-whole-game, task 5.1; tools/screen/README.md,
# "Places and rules"). The game looks for saved games with _FILEEXISTS("*.sav"), which takes no wildcard, so Load
# stays "-" and no saved game is ever loaded: Resume Saved Game at the title menu finds none and starts the game;
# Save writes cws1.sav and then over it; the "-" of Load, chosen by its key, goes back to the Files menu; Quit, No;
# History on, and New Game writes the configuration and goes back to the title menu, where Start NEW Game begins a
# history file; Inform has Recap; a second New Game and Start NEW Game copy the history file aside with SHELL. Then END TURN by rules to the game's end, the Hall of Fame, Game
# Over and Quit.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each; a Retreat menu: the city it starts on; a main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn and End Game menus: Yes; the Options at the end: Quit this Game.
rule 1 key space
rule 3 key space
rule 4 key space
rule 5 key space
rule 6 key space
rule 7 key space
rule 8 key space
rule 9 key space
rule 10 key space
rule 12 key space
rule 13 key space
rule 14:M text e
rule 14:E text y
rule 14:R key enter
rule 14:O text q

# The title menu: Resume Saved Game (none is found: the game starts).
play until 14:C
digest
text r
# March 1861. Files: Save, to cws1.sav.
play until 14:M
digest
text f
prompt
digest
text s
prompt
key enter
# Files: Save again, over cws1.sav (marked +).
prompt
text f
prompt
text s
prompt
digest
key enter
# Files: the "-" of Load, by its key: the Files menu again; Esc.
prompt
text f
prompt
text -
prompt
digest
key esc
# Files: Quit, No.
prompt
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
digest
text n
# UTILITY: History on, out. Files: New Game (the configuration written with history on), to the title menu again:
# Start NEW Game, which begins a history file.
prompt
text u
prompt
text h
prompt
key esc
prompt
text f
prompt
text n
prompt
digest
text s
# Inform: Recap, now that there is a history file; a key.
prompt
text i
prompt
key up
prompt
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
# Files: New Game once more; Start NEW Game: the history file is kept as oldhist.ory (SHELL "copy ...") and a new one
# begun.
prompt
text f
prompt
text n
prompt
text s
play until 14:M
state
text e
prompt
text y
# Turns to the end: the main menu, END TURN (and Yes by the rule).
repeat 7
play until 14:M
digest
text e
end
# The game's end: End Game (Yes by the rule), the Options: Quit; the Hall of Fame: the commander's name; Game Over;
# the title menu: Quit; END's key.
play until 14:O
state
text q
play until 11
state
text Grant
key enter
play until 14:C
state
text q
repeat space
